ng Node install suggestions with ensure_node\n\n* chore: write ASCII-only JSON setup events and show every setup step on the console\n\n* chore: require npx next to a system Node and report every install failure as a setup error\n\n* chore: show progress during on-demand Node installs and remove temp dirs left by killed installs\n\n* fix: report local install failures as install_failed\n\n* fix: download the musl Node build on Alpine x64 and report musl arm64 as unsupported\n\n* fix: match probed Node paths case-insensitively in the setup tests on Windows\n\n* fix: retry moving the unpacked Node into place when Windows briefly denies access\n\n* fix: allow real Windows denials on top of the faked ones in the move-retry test\n\n* chore: escape setup messages before printing them as Rich markup\n\n* fix: redirect the console before loading config in setup --json and run only the stages that apply\n\n* fix: report any unexpected setup stage exception as an error event\n\n* fix: report a download cut short as download_failed and a failed archive write as install_failed\n\n* fix: detect musl from the interpreter's libc and reuse an unrecorded private Node before downloading\n\n* fix: install Node for MCP servers before spawning langgraph dev instead of inside it\n\n* fix: keep the mirror setting out of onboarding detection and the server config fingerprint\n\n* fix: point the MCP README's missing npx entry to the private Node install and EvoSci setup\n\n* fix: strengthen setup tests for activation, npx lookup, version boundary, probe, saved mirror and download progress\n\n* fix: stop retrying a failed Node install within the same process\n\n* fix: record and activate the private Node by absolute path when the data dir is relative\n\n* fix: use a short timeout for the checksum file so a blocked network fails fast\n\n* fix: warn and keep the mirror for the run when setup --cn cannot save the config\n\n* fix: fetch the WebUI package from npmmirror under the cn mirror", "tim